tbl_tuning_ages = tuning.age_rows
Chapter10.Tables.tabs(tbl_tuning_ages,
  [:neuron, :role, :age, :eligible_at_u_0_4, :eligible_probability],
  "ch10_tuning_ages.csv")
```

